{"at":"2026-02-27T16:38:07.312Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":766,"status":"draft","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/navigate-the-mls-dashboard-and-interface/","title":"How do I navigate the MLS dashboard and interface","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>How do I navigate the MLS dashboard and interface</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9398\" class=\"elementor elementor-9398\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-18f6914 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"18f6914\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7db86f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7db86f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Navigating the MLS Dashboard</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b4ccc1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8b4ccc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"chat-history-scroll-container ng-tns-c3858428742-2 show-bottom-shadow ng-trigger ng-trigger-resetChat\"><div class=\"conversation-container ng-tns-c3858428742-2 narrow-container ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"ng-tns-c2575049534-122\"><div class=\"response-container ng-tns-c978905454-123 response-container-has-multiple-responses\"><div class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"response-content ng-trigger ng-trigger-responsePopulation ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:36\">The MLS dashboard is the central hub of your MLS experience. It provides you with a quick overview of your important information, such as upcoming appointments, recent activity, and key performance indicators (KPIs).</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1df5dc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1df5dc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Navigating the MLS Interface</span></h3></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-917510e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"917510e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"chat-history-scroll-container ng-tns-c3858428742-2 show-bottom-shadow ng-trigger ng-trigger-resetChat\"><div class=\"conversation-container ng-tns-c3858428742-2 narrow-container ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"ng-tns-c2575049534-122\"><div class=\"response-container ng-tns-c978905454-123 response-container-has-multiple-responses\"><div class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"response-content ng-trigger ng-trigger-responsePopulation ng-tns-c978905454-123\"><div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\"><p data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:187\">The MLS interface is designed to be user-friendly and easy to navigate.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:57\"><strong>Here are a few tips for navigating the MLS interface:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"54:1-58:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"54:1-54:132\">Pay attention to the colours and fonts of the system. This will help you to identify important elements, such as links and buttons.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"55:1-55:119\">Use the mouse pointer to hover over elements to see tooltips.&nbsp;Tooltips provide additional information about elements.&nbsp;</li><li data-sourcepos=\"56:1-56:89\">Use the keyboard to navigate between elements.&nbsp;This can be faster than using the mouse.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"57:1-58:0\">If you are lost,&nbsp;use the help documentation or contact MLS support for assistance.</li></ul><p><a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ready to dive in? Head to your MLS dashboard and start exploring!</a></p><p><br></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"doc-btm\">\n\t\t    </div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"How do I navigate the MLS dashboard and interface • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}